  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CAFEF Milj&#xf6;l&#xe5;n (MIGA)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflict-Affected and Fragile Economies Facility  (CAFEF/MIGA) Environment loan - Conflict-Affected and Fragile Economies Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFEF (Conflict Affected and Fragile States Economies Facility)       managed by Miga will backed by donor Funds and reinsurance partners   provide political risk insurance to projects in very difficult        contexts that may not go forward without an effective risk-mitigation strategy. Projects insured by the Facility will contribute to         rebuilding efforts by bringing capital, technology, jobs and skills.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CAFEF milj&#xf6;l&#xe5;n (MIGA); Facilitet som syftar till att erbjuda          investerare och banker politisk riskf&#xf6;rs&#xe4;kring i konfliktdrabbade och fragila stater. M&#xf6;jlighet f&#xf6;r Sida att kombinera L&#xe5;ne-och Garantier.   Investeringar ska bl.a. bygga upp f&#xf6;rst&#xf6;rd infrastruktur, skapa nya  arbeten, &#xf6;ka skattebaser och d&#xe4;rmed skapa f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttning f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbar   fred, stabilitet och minskad fattigdom.</narrative>
  </description>
